<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES RESULT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boland beat Northern Transvaal by 55 runs on the third day of a scheduled four-day Supersport Series cricket match in Paarl on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Boland 170 and 179, Northern Transvaal 117 and 177.</p>
</text>
